1
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:09,325
欢迎！这个视频带你从零学会用 GitHub。
Welcome! This video teaches you GitHub from scratch.

2
00:00:09,325 --> 00:00:17,963
先分清两个词：Git 是装在电脑上的存档工具，记录文件的每一次修改。
Two words first: Git is a save tool on your computer that records every change.

3
00:00:17,963 --> 00:00:25,438
GitHub 是一个网站：把存档放到云端，还能和别人一起协作。
GitHub is a website that keeps your saves in the cloud and lets you work with others.

4
00:00:25,438 --> 00:00:33,250
开始前只需要两件事：电脑上装好 Git，并登录你的 GitHub 账号。
Before we start: install Git, and sign in to your GitHub account.

5
00:00:33,250 --> 00:00:41,050
接下来按界面上的按钮逐个讲，顺便讲清背后的原理。开始吧！
We'll go button by button and explain how things work. Let's go!

6
00:00:45,867 --> 00:00:53,092
这是一个 GitHub 仓库的首页。我们从上到下认识每个区域。
This is a GitHub repository page. Let's go through it top to bottom.

7
00:00:53,092 --> 00:01:01,267
仓库（repository）就是一个项目文件夹，外加它的全部修改历史。
A repository is a project folder plus its complete history of changes.

8
00:01:01,267 --> 00:01:04,929
左上角是用户名 / 仓库名。
Top left: username / repository name.

9
00:01:04,929 --> 00:01:11,079
它也是仓库的网址：github.com/用户名/仓库名。
It's also the address: github.com/username/repo-name.

10
00:01:11,079 --> 00:01:19,854
这一排是标签栏：代码、问题、合并请求、自动化、设置……后面逐个讲。
This row of tabs: Code, Issues, Pull requests, Actions, Settings… covered one by one later.

11
00:01:19,854 --> 00:01:28,117
Public 表示公开，任何人都能看；Private 只有你和你邀请的人能看。
Public: anyone can see it. Private: only you and people you invite.

12
00:01:28,117 --> 00:01:35,117
这里是当前所在的分支 main，后面是分支和标签的数量。
This is the current branch, main, followed by the number of branches and tags.

13
00:01:35,117 --> 00:01:39,067
Go to file 按名字快速找文件。
Go to file finds a file by name.

14
00:01:39,067 --> 00:01:44,904
Add file 可以新建文件，或者从电脑上传文件。
Add file creates a new file, or uploads files from your computer.

15
00:01:45,104 --> 00:01:51,717
绿色的 Code 按钮用来把仓库下载到电脑，第 5 章细讲。
The green Code button gets the repo onto your computer (Chapter 5).

16
00:01:51,717 --> 00:02:00,767
文件列表上方：最近一次提交是谁做的、什么时候，以及一共有几次提交。
Above the files: who made the latest commit, when, and the total number of commits.

17
00:02:00,767 --> 00:02:09,067
每一行是一个文件或文件夹，后面是最后修改它的提交说明和时间。
Each row is a file or folder, with its last commit message and time.

18
00:02:09,067 --> 00:02:16,904
右边 About 是简介，还有星标、关注、复刻的数量，第 11 章会讲。
About on the right: a description, plus stars, watchers and forks (Chapter 11).

19
00:02:17,504 --> 00:02:24,792
往下滚动，会看到 README.md 的内容，它是项目的"说明书"。
Scroll down to see README.md, the "manual" of the project.

20
00:02:24,792 --> 00:02:35,692
原理：GitHub 会自动寻找名叫 README 的文件，排好版放在首页。所以每个项目都应该写一个。
How it works: GitHub looks for a file named README and shows it here, so every project should have one.

21
00:02:35,692 --> 00:02:43,929
Languages 显示项目用了哪些编程语言，是 GitHub 按文件自动统计的。
Languages shows which programming languages are used, counted automatically from the files.

22
00:02:44,529 --> 00:02:47,229
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

23
00:02:51,229 --> 00:02:55,754
记住：仓库 = 项目文件 + 完整历史。
Remember: repository = project files + full history.

24
00:03:00,567 --> 00:03:06,617
刚才那个仓库是怎么来的？我们从头新建一个。
Where did that repository come from? Let's create one from scratch.

25
00:03:06,617 --> 00:03:12,492
在任何页面，点右上角的 +，选 New repository。
On any page, click + at the top right and choose New repository.

26
00:03:12,642 --> 00:03:18,029
首页左边的绿色 New 按钮，作用完全一样。
The green New button on the left of your home page does the same thing.

27
00:03:19,029 --> 00:03:26,829
先起名字：只用英文字母、数字和短横线，不要用空格和中文。
First, a name: letters, numbers and dashes only, no spaces or Chinese.

28
00:03:26,829 --> 00:03:35,367
绿色提示说明这个名字可以用。Description 是一句话简介，可以不填。
Green means the name is free. Description is a one-line summary; optional.

29
00:03:35,367 --> 00:03:44,129
Public 所有人可见，适合放作品；Private 只有自己能看，适合私人作业。
Public: everyone can see it, good for showing work. Private: only you, good for personal work.

30
00:03:44,129 --> 00:03:49,429
两种都免费，以后也能在设置里随时改。
Both are free, and you can switch later in Settings.

31
00:03:49,429 --> 00:03:57,054
勾选 Add a README file：仓库一建好就有说明书，可以直接使用。
Check Add a README file so the repo starts with a manual and is ready to use.

32
00:03:57,054 --> 00:04:04,179
.gitignore 模板：告诉 Git 哪些文件不要上传，第 7 章细讲。
.gitignore template: tells Git which files not to upload (Chapter 7).

33
00:04:04,179 --> 00:04:13,267
License 许可证：说明别人能不能使用你的代码。练习用的仓库可以先不选。
License: says whether others may use your code. Skip it for practice repos.

34
00:04:13,267 --> 00:04:16,867
最后点 Create repository。
Finally, click Create repository.

35
00:04:17,867 --> 00:04:26,142
建好了！里面已经有一个 README.md，还有第一次提交 Initial commit。
Done! It already has README.md and its first commit, Initial commit.

36
00:04:26,742 --> 00:04:33,267
仓库到底是什么？其实就是一个普通的项目文件夹……
What is a repository? Really, just an ordinary project folder…

37
00:04:33,267 --> 00:04:41,242
……里面多了一个隐藏的 .git 文件夹，所有存档和历史都存在那里。
…plus a hidden .git folder where all the saves and history are stored.

38
00:04:41,242 --> 00:04:47,467
GitHub 上的仓库，就是把这个文件夹放到了云端。
A repository on GitHub is simply this folder, kept in the cloud.

39
00:04:48,067 --> 00:04:50,767
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

40
00:04:54,767 --> 00:05:00,517
记住：仓库就是一个带着 .git 历史的文件夹。
Remember: a repository is a folder with a .git history inside.

41
00:05:05,333 --> 00:05:12,146
这是仓库首页。点开 README.md，看看单个文件的页面。
This is the repo home page. Open README.md to see what a single file looks like.

42
00:05:12,146 --> 00:05:18,946
这就是文件页。左边是文件树，用来在文件之间跳转。
This is the file page. The file tree on the left lets you jump between files.

43
00:05:18,946 --> 00:05:25,496
这一栏显示：最后一次是谁、什么时候、改了什么。
This bar shows who changed it last, when, and what they changed.

44
00:05:25,496 --> 00:05:31,083
Preview 显示排好版的效果，看起来像网页。
Preview shows the formatted result, like a web page.

45
00:05:31,083 --> 00:05:35,833
点 Code，看到的是文件的原始内容。
Click Code to see the raw content of the file.

46
00:05:36,433 --> 00:05:42,358
原来 # 和 - 都是排版符号，这种写法叫 Markdown。
The # and - are formatting marks. This style is called Markdown.

47
00:05:42,358 --> 00:05:47,996
左边的数字是行号，方便说"第 5 行有问题"。
The numbers on the left are line numbers, handy for saying "line 5 has a problem".

48
00:05:47,996 --> 00:05:53,608
右边这排按钮，先看 Raw，意思是"原始的"。
Now the buttons on the right. First, Raw, meaning "unprocessed".

49
00:05:54,608 --> 00:06:01,908
它打开一个纯文字页面，方便复制，或者给程序直接读取。
It opens a plain-text page: easy to copy, or for programs to read directly.

50
00:06:02,508 --> 00:06:07,808
这个是复制：一键复制整个文件的内容。
This is Copy: copy the whole file in one click.

51
00:06:08,008 --> 00:06:13,558
这个是下载：只把这一个文件存到电脑上。
This is Download: save just this one file to your computer.

52
00:06:13,758 --> 00:06:19,558
这支铅笔是编辑按钮：直接在网页上改文件。
The pencil is the Edit button: change the file right in your browser.

53
00:06:20,558 --> 00:06:25,608
进入编辑器了。我们在最后加两行字。
We're in the editor. Let's add two lines at the end.

54
00:06:25,608 --> 00:06:31,458
改完还没保存！要点右上角的 Commit changes...
It's not saved yet! Click Commit changes... at the top right.

55
00:06:31,458 --> 00:06:37,608
在 GitHub 上，修改必须提交（commit）才算保存。
On GitHub, a change is only saved once you commit it.

56
00:06:37,608 --> 00:06:45,633
先写一句提交说明：这次改了什么。要具体，别写"改了点东西"。
Write a commit message saying what you changed. Be specific, not "changed stuff".

57
00:06:45,633 --> 00:06:53,471
下面选"直接提交到 main"。另一个选项和分支有关，第 8 章再讲。
Choose "Commit directly to main". The other option is about branches (Chapter 8).

58
00:06:53,471 --> 00:06:56,733
最后点 Commit changes。
Finally, click Commit changes.

59
00:06:56,733 --> 00:07:04,821
成功！顶部出现了刚写的说明，还有一串编号 3f9c2a1。它是什么？
Done! Your message is at the top, next to a code: 3f9c2a1. What is that?

60
00:07:05,421 --> 00:07:12,646
commit 就像游戏存档：把整个项目此刻的样子拍一张快照。
A commit is like a game save: a snapshot of the whole project at this moment.

61
00:07:12,646 --> 00:07:19,058
每提交一次，就多一个存档。这个仓库现在有 4 个。
Every commit adds one more save. This repo now has 4.

62
00:07:19,058 --> 00:07:27,858
箭头表示：每个存档都记着上一个，连成一条历史链，随时可以回去看。
Each save remembers the previous one, forming a history chain you can revisit anytime.

63
00:07:27,858 --> 00:07:35,158
那串编号叫哈希值，由内容计算得出，是存档的身份证号。
That code is a hash, calculated from the content: the save's ID number.

64
00:07:35,158 --> 00:07:42,208
内容改一个字，号码就全变。所以历史没法被偷偷篡改。
Change one character and the hash changes completely, so history can't be secretly altered.

65
00:07:42,808 --> 00:07:45,508
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

66
00:07:48,508 --> 00:07:53,233
记住：改完必须 commit，才算保存。
Remember: a change only counts once you commit it.

67
00:07:58,067 --> 00:08:05,367
上一章我们提交了一次修改。怎么查看所有的修改记录呢？
We made a commit in the last chapter. How do we see all the changes ever made?

68
00:08:05,367 --> 00:08:09,454
点文件列表右上角的 Commits。
Click Commits at the top right of the file list.

69
00:08:09,454 --> 00:08:18,254
这就是提交历史：最新的在最上面，每条都有说明、作者、时间和编号。
This is the commit history: newest on top, each with a message, author, time and code.

70
00:08:18,254 --> 00:08:24,054
说明写得清楚，这个列表就像一本项目日记。
With clear messages, this list reads like a diary of the project.

71
00:08:24,054 --> 00:08:29,354
点开最上面这条，看看它到底改了什么。
Let's open the top one and see exactly what it changed.

72
00:08:30,354 --> 00:08:36,404
上面写着改了几个文件、加了几行、删了几行。
At the top: how many files changed, and how many lines were added or removed.

73
00:08:36,404 --> 00:08:45,129
下面就是 diff（差异）：绿色带 + 的是新增的行，红色带 - 的是删掉的行。
Below is the diff: green + lines were added, red - lines were removed.

74
00:08:45,129 --> 00:08:52,904
最上面 @@ 开头的一行，说明改动从第几行开始，可以先不管它。
The line starting with @@ says where the change starts; you can ignore it for now.

75
00:08:53,504 --> 00:08:58,392
原理：Git 把新旧两个版本逐行对比。
How it works: Git compares the old and new versions line by line.

76
00:08:58,392 --> 00:09:04,892
相同的行跳过，只把不同的行标出来，这就是 diff。
Matching lines are skipped; only the differences are marked. That is a diff.

77
00:09:05,592 --> 00:09:12,679
在文件页上，History 按钮只显示和这个文件有关的提交。
On a file page, History shows only the commits that touched this file.

78
00:09:12,679 --> 00:09:15,792
旁边的 Blame 更厉害：
Blame, next to Code, goes even further:

79
00:09:16,292 --> 00:09:24,842
每一行旁边都标出：是谁、在哪次提交里写的。颜色越深，改动越新。
Next to every line: who wrote it, and in which commit. Darker means more recent.

80
00:09:24,842 --> 00:09:31,892
程序出问题时特别有用：马上就能知道这一行该去问谁。
Very handy when something breaks: you instantly know who to ask about a line.

81
00:09:32,492 --> 00:09:35,192
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

82
00:09:38,392 --> 00:09:42,529
记住：Git 记得每一行的来历。
Remember: Git remembers where every line came from.

83
00:09:47,333 --> 00:09:55,633
到目前为止，我们都在网页上操作。怎么把仓库拿到自己电脑上呢？
So far we've worked on the website. How do we get the repo onto our own computer?

84
00:09:56,233 --> 00:10:01,233
点绿色的 Code 按钮，里面有两种方法。
Click the green Code button. There are two ways.

85
00:10:01,233 --> 00:10:09,496
Download ZIP：只下载文件的"复印件"，没有历史，也没法同步回去。
Download ZIP: a plain copy of the files. Easy, but no history and no syncing back.

86
00:10:09,496 --> 00:10:16,508
HTTPS 地址：配合 git clone，得到能来回同步的完整仓库。
The HTTPS URL is used with git clone to get a full repository that stays in sync.

87
00:10:16,508 --> 00:10:20,808
点右边的按钮，复制这个地址。
Click the button on the right to copy the address.

88
00:10:21,608 --> 00:10:28,658
打开 PowerShell：在开始菜单里搜索 PowerShell 就能找到。
Open PowerShell: search for it in the Start menu.

89
00:10:28,658 --> 00:10:35,896
先确认 Git 装好了：输入 git --version，能看到版本号就行。
First check that Git is installed: type git --version and look for a version number.

90
00:10:35,896 --> 00:10:42,833
用 cd 进入桌面（cd 就是 change directory，切换文件夹）。
Use cd to go to the Desktop (cd = change directory).

91
00:10:42,833 --> 00:10:52,158
输入 git clone，后面粘贴刚才复制的地址（在 PowerShell 里点右键就能粘贴）。
Type git clone, then paste the address (right-click pastes in PowerShell).

92
00:10:52,158 --> 00:10:58,796
完成！Git 把整个仓库连同全部历史，都下载下来了。
Done! Git downloaded the whole repository, history included.

93
00:10:58,796 --> 00:11:06,071
进入这个文件夹，再用 ls 列出文件：和网页上的一模一样。
Go into the folder and list files with ls: exactly the same as on the website.

94
00:11:06,071 --> 00:11:11,671
git log --oneline 查看历史：4 次提交全都在。
git log --oneline shows the history: all 4 commits are here.

95
00:11:12,771 --> 00:11:21,308
clone 之后，GitHub 上和你电脑上各有一份完整的仓库，包括全部历史。
After cloning, GitHub and your computer each hold a complete copy, with full history.

96
00:11:21,308 --> 00:11:27,521
Git 会把 GitHub 上那份记作 origin，意思是"来源"。
Git calls the GitHub copy origin, meaning "where it came from".

97
00:11:27,521 --> 00:11:34,321
之后的任务，就是让这两份保持同步。下一章就来做。
From now on, the job is keeping the two in sync. That's next.

98
00:11:34,921 --> 00:11:37,621
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

99
00:11:41,621 --> 00:11:46,983
记住：clone 得到的是带完整历史的仓库。
Remember: clone gives you the full repository, history and all.

100
00:11:51,800 --> 00:12:00,113
在电脑上 commit 之前，先告诉 Git 你是谁。每台电脑只需要设置一次。
Before committing on your computer, tell Git who you are. Once per computer.

101
00:12:05,762 --> 00:12:13,738
邮箱最好填注册 GitHub 用的那个，这样提交记录会显示你的头像。
Use the email of your GitHub account so commits show your avatar.

102
00:12:14,238 --> 00:12:23,113
现在随便改点东西：用记事本打开 hello.py，加一行，然后按 Ctrl+S 保存。
Now change something: open hello.py in Notepad, add a line, press Ctrl+S to save.

103
00:12:23,613 --> 00:12:29,300
回到 PowerShell。git status 查看现在的状态。
Back in PowerShell. git status shows the current state.

104
00:12:29,300 --> 00:12:36,500
hello.py 被修改了。红色表示：这个修改还没准备好提交。
hello.py was modified. Red means the change is not yet ready to commit.

105
00:12:36,500 --> 00:12:43,600
git add hello.py 把这个修改放进"暂存区"。再看一次状态：
git add hello.py puts the change in the "staging area". Check the status again:

106
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:49,650
变成绿色了：这个修改已经准备好，等待提交。
Now it's green: the change is staged and ready to commit.

107
00:12:49,650 --> 00:12:55,662
git commit -m "说明" 提交，就在本地存了一个档。
git commit -m "message" makes a save on your computer.

108
00:12:57,327 --> 00:13:05,352
注意 "ahead by 1 commit"：这个存档只在你的电脑上，GitHub 还没有。
Note "ahead by 1 commit": this save exists only on your computer, not on GitHub yet.

109
00:13:05,352 --> 00:13:10,364
git push 把本地的新存档上传到 GitHub。
git push uploads your new saves to GitHub.

110
00:13:10,664 --> 00:13:20,027
第一次 push 会弹出登录窗口：点 Sign in with your browser，在浏览器里授权就行。
The first push asks you to sign in: click Sign in with your browser and approve.

111
00:13:20,727 --> 00:13:25,614
只要登录这一次，以后 Git 会记住你。
You only sign in once; Git remembers you afterwards.

112
00:13:28,244 --> 00:13:34,907
回到网页刷新：新的提交已经出现了！现在一共 5 次。
Refresh the web page: the new commit is there! 5 commits now.

113
00:13:36,007 --> 00:13:43,844
反过来：如果网页上有了新改动，用 git pull 把它们拉到电脑上。
The other way round: if GitHub has new changes, git pull brings them to your computer.

114
00:13:43,844 --> 00:13:51,307
现在两边一样，所以显示 "Already up to date"（已经是最新）。
Both sides match right now, so it says "Already up to date".

115
00:13:51,907 --> 00:13:56,457
把刚才的流程画出来，一共四站。
Let's draw what just happened. There are four stops.

116
00:13:56,457 --> 00:14:03,757
工作区：你正在编辑的文件，也就是文件夹里看到的样子。
Working directory: the files you are editing, as you see them in the folder.

117
00:14:03,757 --> 00:14:12,482
暂存区：git add 挑出这次要存的修改，就像寄快递前先把东西放进箱子。
Staging area: git add picks the changes to save, like packing items into a box.

118
00:14:12,482 --> 00:14:18,794
本地仓库：git commit 把箱子封好，存成一个存档。
Local repository: git commit seals the box and stores it as a save.

119
00:14:18,794 --> 00:14:23,807
远程仓库：git push 把存档寄到 GitHub。
Remote repository: git push ships the saves to GitHub.

120
00:14:23,807 --> 00:14:29,819
git pull 方向相反：把 GitHub 上的新存档取回来。
git pull goes the other way: it fetches new saves from GitHub.

121
00:14:29,819 --> 00:14:39,869
为什么要有暂存区？因为你可以只挑一部分修改提交，让每个存档都干净、有条理。
Why a staging area? You can commit only some changes, keeping each save clean and focused.

122
00:14:40,469 --> 00:14:43,169
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

123
00:14:47,169 --> 00:14:51,519
记住口诀：改 → add → commit → push。
Remember the rhythm: edit → add → commit → push.

124
00:14:56,333 --> 00:15:00,558
有些文件不应该上传到 GitHub：
Some files should never go to GitHub:

125
00:15:00,558 --> 00:15:08,858
尤其是公开仓库，里面的内容全世界都能看到，泄露密码就麻烦了。
Anything in a public repo is visible to the whole world; leaking a password is serious.

126
00:15:09,358 --> 00:15:19,271
比如运行程序后，多了一个缓存文件夹 __pycache__，还有一个存密码的 secret.txt。
Say running the program created a __pycache__ folder, and you keep passwords in secret.txt.

127
00:15:19,271 --> 00:15:25,333
Git 发现了它们，一不小心 git add 就会被传上去。
Git sees them, and one careless git add would upload them.

128
00:15:25,833 --> 00:15:35,758
解决办法：在仓库最外层新建一个叫 .gitignore 的文件，每行写一个要忽略的名字。
The fix: create a file named .gitignore in the repo, one name to ignore per line.

129
00:15:35,758 --> 00:15:40,921
# 开头的是注释，只是写给人看的说明。
Lines starting with # are comments, notes for humans only.

130
00:15:41,421 --> 00:15:48,846
保存后再看状态：那两个文件不见了，只剩 .gitignore 本身。
Save it and check again: those two are gone. Only .gitignore itself remains.

131
00:15:48,846 --> 00:15:57,771
把 .gitignore 也提交上去，这样每个下载这个仓库的人都遵守同样的规则。
Commit .gitignore too, so everyone who clones the repo follows the same rules.

132
00:15:57,771 --> 00:16:07,796
小技巧：在 GitHub 新建仓库时可以直接选 .gitignore 模板，比如 Python，省得自己写。
Tip: when creating a repo on GitHub, pick a .gitignore template such as Python.

133
00:16:08,396 --> 00:16:18,158
原理：Git 每次检查文件时，都会先对照 .gitignore 这份名单，名单上的直接跳过。
How it works: Git checks .gitignore first and skips anything on the list.

134
00:16:18,158 --> 00:16:28,583
注意：如果文件已经提交过，写进 .gitignore 也不会自动删掉，所以最好一开始就写好。
Careful: files already committed stay in the repo, so set up .gitignore early.

135
00:16:29,183 --> 00:16:31,883
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

136
00:16:35,083 --> 00:16:39,808
记住：密码永远不要上传到 GitHub。
Remember: never upload passwords to GitHub.

137
00:16:44,633 --> 00:16:50,933
想尝试新改动，又怕把能用的版本改坏？用分支。
Want to try something without breaking the working version? Use a branch.

138
00:16:50,933 --> 00:16:59,208
分支就像平行时间线：从某个存档分出去，在上面接着做新的存档……
A branch is a parallel timeline: it splits off from a save and continues with new saves…

139
00:16:59,208 --> 00:17:07,433
……而主线 main 完全不受影响。改好了再合并回去，改砸了直接扔掉。
…while main stays untouched. Merge it back if it works; throw it away if not.

140
00:17:08,033 --> 00:17:13,033
在网页上：点左上方的分支按钮 main。
On the website: click the branch button, main.

141
00:17:13,633 --> 00:17:22,658
列表里是所有分支，打勾的是当前所在的分支。在输入框里打一个新名字……
It lists all branches; the tick marks the current one. Type a new name in the box…

142
00:17:22,658 --> 00:17:27,533
……再点 Create branch，分支就建好了。
…then click Create branch, and it's done.

143
00:17:27,533 --> 00:17:35,933
分支名要简短、能看出在做什么，比如 add-greeting（添加问候语）。
Keep branch names short and descriptive, like add-greeting.

144
00:17:37,033 --> 00:17:44,321
在电脑上：git switch -c 分支名，新建一个分支并切换过去。
On your computer: git switch -c name creates a branch and switches to it.

145
00:17:44,321 --> 00:17:50,883
git branch 列出所有分支，带星号的是你当前所在的。
git branch lists all branches; the star marks the current one.

146
00:17:51,383 --> 00:17:57,683
在这个分支上，把问候语改得更热情一点，保存。
On this branch, make the greeting warmer, then save.

147
00:17:58,183 --> 00:18:00,996
照常 add 和 commit。
Add and commit as usual.

148
00:18:02,219 --> 00:18:12,219
第一次推送新分支，要写成 git push -u origin 分支名，告诉 Git 推到 GitHub 的哪个分支。
The first push of a new branch: git push -u origin name tells Git where it goes.

149
00:18:12,219 --> 00:18:21,569
现在 main 完全没变，新改动只在 add-greeting 上。怎么合并回主线？看下一章。
main hasn't changed at all; the new work lives on add-greeting. Merging is next.

150
00:18:21,569 --> 00:18:29,831
补充：git switch main 可以切回主线，文件夹里的文件会跟着变回去。
Bonus: git switch main jumps back, and your files change back with it.

151
00:18:30,431 --> 00:18:33,131
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

152
00:18:37,131 --> 00:18:43,381
记住：新功能放在分支上做，main 永远保持能用。
Remember: build new things on a branch; keep main working.

153
00:18:48,200 --> 00:18:56,637
推送分支后，仓库首页会出现一条黄色提示。点 Compare & pull request。
After pushing a branch, a yellow banner appears. Click Compare & pull request.

154
00:18:57,637 --> 00:19:08,125
Pull Request（简称 PR）就是"合并请求"：请大家看看我的改动，同意的话就合并进主线。
A Pull Request (PR) asks: please review my changes, and merge them if they look good.

155
00:19:08,125 --> 00:19:14,863
base 是要合并进去的分支 main，compare 是你的新分支。
base is the branch to merge into (main); compare is your new branch.

156
00:19:14,863 --> 00:19:20,900
Able to merge 表示两边没有冲突，可以自动合并。
Able to merge means there are no conflicts; it can merge automatically.

157
00:19:20,900 --> 00:19:26,450
写清楚标题和说明：改了什么、为什么改。
Write a clear title and description: what changed, and why.

158
00:19:27,391 --> 00:19:31,103
最后点 Create pull request。
Then click Create pull request.

159
00:19:32,103 --> 00:19:37,578
PR 建好了，绿色的 Open 表示正在等待处理。
The PR is created. The green Open badge means it is waiting for review.

160
00:19:37,578 --> 00:19:47,116
Conversation 是讨论区，Commits 是包含的提交，Files changed 是具体改了哪些行。
Conversation is for discussion, Commits lists commits, Files changed shows the edits.

161
00:19:47,716 --> 00:19:57,841
这里是改动的 diff。队友可以在任意一行留言提意见，这叫 Code Review（代码审查）。
Here's the diff. Teammates can comment on any line. This is code review.

162
00:19:57,841 --> 00:20:05,566
有意见就继续改、继续 push，PR 会自动更新，直到大家都满意。
Need changes? Just commit and push again; the PR updates automatically.

163
00:20:06,166 --> 00:20:10,741
没问题了，就点 Merge pull request……
When everyone is happy, click Merge pull request…

164
00:20:10,741 --> 00:20:14,366
……再点 Confirm merge 确认。
…and Confirm merge.

165
00:20:14,966 --> 00:20:20,391
变成紫色的 Merged：改动已经进入 main 了！
Purple Merged: the changes are now in main!

166
00:20:20,391 --> 00:20:28,041
分支已经完成任务，点 Delete branch 删掉它，让仓库保持整洁。
The branch has done its job. Click Delete branch to keep things tidy.

167
00:20:29,141 --> 00:20:36,428
最后回到电脑：切回 main，git pull 拿到合并后的最新代码。
Back on your computer: switch to main and git pull the merged code.

168
00:20:37,028 --> 00:20:42,303
原理：合并就是把两条时间线汇到一起……
How it works: merging joins the two timelines…

169
00:20:42,303 --> 00:20:49,053
……生成一个新的存档，它同时记着两条线的"上一个"。
…into a new save that remembers the previous save of both lines.

170
00:20:49,053 --> 00:20:56,578
PR 的价值在于：改动进入主线之前，先被别人看过、讨论过。
The value of a PR: changes are reviewed and discussed before they reach main.

171
00:20:57,178 --> 00:20:59,878
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

172
00:21:04,678 --> 00:21:11,291
记住：分支 → PR → 审查 → 合并，这就是团队协作的节奏。
Remember: branch → PR → review → merge, the rhythm of teamwork.

173
00:21:16,100 --> 00:21:22,488
Git 很聪明：两个人改不同的地方，它能自动合并。
Git is smart: when two people change different places, it merges automatically.

174
00:21:22,488 --> 00:21:28,013
但如果两个人把同一行改成了不同的样子……
But if two people change the same line in different ways…

175
00:21:28,013 --> 00:21:35,875
……Git 不知道该听谁的，只能停下来让人决定。这就是合并冲突。
…Git can't know who is right, so it stops and asks a human. That's a merge conflict.

176
00:21:35,875 --> 00:21:41,675
冲突不是错误，只是需要你做个选择，别慌。
A conflict isn't an error. It just needs you to choose. Don't panic.

177
00:21:42,275 --> 00:21:50,600
这时 PR 页面会提示有冲突，合并按钮也变灰了。点 Resolve conflicts。
The PR now reports a conflict and the merge button is greyed out. Click Resolve conflicts.

178
00:21:51,600 --> 00:21:57,400
冲突的地方被这样标了出来，我们来读一读。
Here's how the conflict is marked. Let's read it.

179
00:21:57,400 --> 00:22:03,275
<<<<<<< 到 ======= 之间，是你这个分支的版本。
Between <<<<<<< and ======= is your branch's version.

180
00:22:03,275 --> 00:22:08,600
======= 到 >>>>>>> 之间，是 main 上的版本。
Between ======= and >>>>>>> is the version on main.

181
00:22:08,600 --> 00:22:18,150
解决方法：删掉这三行标记，留下想要的内容。可以选一边，也可以两边结合。
To resolve: delete the three marker lines and keep what you want, either side or a mix.

182
00:22:18,150 --> 00:22:24,700
这里我们结合两边：保留中文的热情，也加上英文。
Here we combine both: keep the warm Chinese greeting and add English.

183
00:22:24,700 --> 00:22:32,313
改好后点 Mark as resolved（标记为已解决），再点 Commit merge。
Then click Mark as resolved, and Commit merge.

184
00:22:33,313 --> 00:22:37,863
冲突解决了，又可以正常合并了。
Conflict resolved. The PR can be merged normally again.

185
00:22:38,463 --> 00:22:47,563
电脑上 git pull 遇到冲突也一样：删掉标记、留下正确内容，再 add 和 commit。
Conflicts during git pull work the same: edit the file, remove the markers, then add and commit.

186
00:22:48,163 --> 00:22:50,863
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

187
00:22:54,863 --> 00:23:01,413
记住：冲突不可怕，删掉标记、留下对的内容就好。
Remember: conflicts are fine: remove the markers, keep the right content.

188
00:23:06,233 --> 00:23:13,996
这是别人的公开仓库。右上角有三个按钮：Watch、Fork、Star。
This is someone else's public repo. Top right: Watch, Fork, Star.

189
00:23:13,996 --> 00:23:21,721
Star（星标）= 收藏 + 点赞：方便以后找到，也是对作者的鼓励。
Star = bookmark + like: easy to find later, and encouraging for the author.

190
00:23:21,721 --> 00:23:30,671
点完变成黄色的 Starred，数字也加了 1。星越多，通常说明项目越受欢迎。
It turns into a yellow Starred, and the count goes up. More stars usually means more popular.

191
00:23:30,671 --> 00:23:39,521
Watch（关注）是订阅通知：选 All Activity，仓库有任何动静都会通知你。
Watch subscribes to notifications: pick All Activity to hear about everything.

192
00:23:40,071 --> 00:23:47,071
Fork（复刻）：把整个仓库复制一份到你自己的账号下。
Fork copies the whole repository into your own account.

193
00:23:48,071 --> 00:23:57,571
为什么要 Fork？因为你没有权限直接改别人的仓库，但可以随便改自己的副本。
Why fork? You can't change someone else's repo, but you can change your own copy.

194
00:23:57,571 --> 00:24:01,246
确认名字，点 Create fork。
Check the name and click Create fork.

195
00:24:02,246 --> 00:24:10,896
现在它在你名下了，下面还标着 "forked from"，说明是从哪里复制来的。
Now it's under your name, with "forked from" showing where it came from.

196
00:24:11,496 --> 00:24:18,883
在副本里改好并提交后，这里会显示"领先原仓库 1 个提交"。
After you commit in your copy, it says you are "1 commit ahead" of the original.

197
00:24:18,883 --> 00:24:28,358
点 Contribute → Open pull request，就能把改动提交给原作者，由他决定是否合并。
Click Contribute → Open pull request to offer your changes; the owner decides.

198
00:24:29,508 --> 00:24:34,233
整个流程：先 Fork 一份到自己名下……
The full flow: first Fork a copy into your account…

199
00:24:34,233 --> 00:24:37,733
……在副本上修改、提交……
…edit and commit in your copy…

200
00:24:37,733 --> 00:24:42,246
……再发 Pull Request 请原作者合并。
…then send a Pull Request asking the owner to merge.

201
00:24:42,246 --> 00:24:48,796
全世界成千上万的开源项目，都是这样一起完成的。
Countless open-source projects around the world are built exactly this way.

202
00:24:49,596 --> 00:24:58,883
最后看 Issues 标签：它是项目的"问题清单"，报 bug、提建议、记待办都用它。
Finally, the Issues tab: the project's to-do list for bugs, ideas and tasks.

203
00:24:58,883 --> 00:25:02,083
点 New issue 新建一个。
Click New issue to create one.

204
00:25:03,083 --> 00:25:10,883
标题一句话说清问题，描述里写清楚怎么发现的、希望怎么改。
A one-line title, then describe how you found it and what should change.

205
00:25:10,883 --> 00:25:18,458
右边的 Assignees 指定谁来负责，Labels 给问题分类，比如 bug。
Assignees says who handles it; Labels categorise it, e.g. bug.

206
00:25:20,561 --> 00:25:26,399
建好了！每个 Issue 都有一个编号，这个是 #3。
Created! Every issue gets a number; this one is #3.

207
00:25:26,399 --> 00:25:32,849
编号和 PR 共用一套，所以前面的两个 PR 占了 #1 和 #2。
Issues and PRs share numbers, so our two PRs took #1 and #2.

208
00:25:32,849 --> 00:25:37,774
修好之后，在 PR 说明里写上 Closes #3。
Once fixed, write Closes #3 in the PR description.

209
00:25:38,374 --> 00:25:45,936
PR 一合并，这个 Issue 就会自动关闭，并记录是哪个 PR 修好的。
When that PR merges, the issue closes automatically and links to the fix.

210
00:25:46,536 --> 00:25:49,236
本章小结。
Chapter recap.

211
00:25:54,036 --> 00:26:00,186
记住：Fork + PR 参与别人的项目，Issue 记录问题。
Remember: Fork + PR to contribute; Issues to track problems.

212
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:12,450
最后一个标签 Settings（设置），只有仓库的主人才能看到。
The last tab, Settings, is visible only to the repository owner.

213
00:26:12,450 --> 00:26:16,288
General 里可以给仓库改名。
Under General you can rename the repository.

214
00:26:16,288 --> 00:26:24,825
拉到最下面是 Danger Zone（危险区）：改公开/私有、转让、删除仓库。
At the bottom is the Danger Zone: change visibility, transfer, or delete the repo.

215
00:26:24,825 --> 00:26:33,050
删除仓库无法恢复，GitHub 会让你输入仓库名确认，一定要想清楚。
Deleting cannot be undone; GitHub makes you type the name to confirm. Be sure.

216
00:26:34,985 --> 00:26:44,760
Collaborators（协作者）：点 Add people 邀请同学，他们就能直接往这个仓库提交。
Collaborators: click Add people to invite friends who can then push directly.

217
00:26:45,960 --> 00:26:51,760
这张速查表总结了整个视频，建议截图保存。
This cheat sheet sums up the whole video. Take a screenshot!

218
00:26:58,560 --> 00:27:03,785
恭喜你，GitHub 的核心用法你都学会了！
Congratulations, you've learned the essentials of GitHub!

219
00:27:03,785 --> 00:27:13,010
最好的练习方法：今天就建一个仓库，把学习笔记放上去，每天 commit 一次。
Best practice: create a repo today, put your notes in it, and commit every day.
